    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard the sharp wind in my eardrums as beads of blood dripped down from small scratches on my ear."
    },
    {
        "text": "The spearhead was stuck by my left foot, and half buried in the ground."
    },
    {
        "text": "When I turned around, I saw the old man's clouded... shaky eyes."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How... could I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine, calm down...",
        "tag": "name",
